# Every root filesystem (p1) change scripts/build-cachyos1160-k73-image.sh is
# allowed to make to the official ps5-cachyos image, apart from the kernel
# package swap. The build compares full before/after file manifests of the
# root partition. Paths owned by linux-ps5 7.1.7-1 or 7.3.0-3 are the kernel
# swap, which pacman checks; every other difference must match this list
# exactly.
#
# Columns: status path type mode uid gid size sha256-or-link-target
# Status: A added, M modified (new values), R removed (old values).
# The fan helper, the two Wi-Fi modules and the initramfs are built by the
# same run, so their sizes and hashes are filled in from that build.
A boot/initrd.img-7.3.0 f 0600 0 0 @INITRD_SIZE@ @INITRD_SHA256@
R boot/initrd.img-7.1.7 f 0600 0 0 54367236 ba6dd1d0e69149e6be60bfd655b4bfc8cac0eee546e1ba478f3bdd1240965a56
